/scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974535_169047908250742_8418151156766296047_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9K_gemlQnacQ7kNvwHz4UDD&_nc_oc=AdqiADXQLht8z_IMMcXUvvf84ZxAwxy6htESz_8oMgCDbGGhs0b7ARi2qJO6CHYNiKw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSdmE9LOtXrBvFnhgkbmXvwxRgF0LNprQulwQk361tTSw&oe=6B047FF8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_Image_Cover_2560x1440.png", "id": "418797219253351", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974555_418797222586684_516936567010903441_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eOP0JwpgldgQ7kNvwEQA7Lv&_nc_oc=AdpelndPm_zNd8eQPPzQRWKC-3zF1TG58OUDENgGMOLMfV2s2L7eg-1_qMrva1KEgNs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSnVAMVPh6op1SlWEuaHasgbfX4clmNDK1Dzs-Ocg3WxQ&oe=6B048780"}, "display_name": "DoVille Adventures", "keywords": [], "long_description": "DoVille Adventures has launched! Designed by a team that includes older, nostalgic adults, it's your vacation dream come true! Episode One, Juniper Beach, is a low poly BEACH adventure. Thrill to easy-to-use summer activities; catch the mysterious art thief and save the beach, or simply stretch out for an extended stay in the warm, warm sun. Take a dip, water ski, or ride the hot-air balloon. For more information (and even a report on the positive brain effects, visit doville dot fun). ", "short_description": "DoVille Adventures has launched! Here's one you can hand to Granny with your (old) Oculus Go. Designed by a team that includes older, nostalgic adults, it's your vacation dream come true! Episode One, Juniper Beach, is a low poly BEACH adventure. Thrill to easy-to-use activities; catch the mysterious art thief and save the beach, or simply stretch out for an extended stay in the warm, warm sun."}]}, "developer_name": "Project Whitecard Digital Inc.", "developer_privacy_policy_url":